    "detailed_description": "<h1>Other Games</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can start managing your market in the Prologue version of <strong>'Bazaar Simulator'</strong> and enjoy the limited experience. Don't forget to add and follow the full version of the game on your wishlist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Traditional Scale System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weigh your fruits and vegetables accurately using the traditional scales used in markets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033810/extras/c39cb8e77194d5dfb9a7d152c5ef8b09.poster.avif?t=1753376621\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033810/extras/c39cb8e77194d5dfb9a7d152c5ef8b09.webm?t=1753376621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033810/extras/c39cb8e77194d5dfb9a7d152c5ef8b09.mp4?t=1753376621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stock Ordering and Management</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase your stocks, organize their placement, and transfer them from crates to stalls. Remember, fruits and vegetables start to spoil over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033810/extras/dfd7cdcde7124e88c9707b79a66a68d5.poster.avif?t=1753376621\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033810/extras/dfd7cdcde7124e88c9707b79a66a68d5.webm?t=1753376621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033810/extras/dfd7cdcde7124e88c9707b79a66a68d5.mp4?t=1753376621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interactive Sales Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assist customers in their selections and manage payments both in cash and via QR code or IBAN. Ensure every customer leaves satisfied, creating repeat customers and a lively market atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033810/extras/eb3ffe9decea696c5c273d522188d5c5.poster.avif?t=1753376621\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033810/extras/eb3ffe9decea696c5c273d522188d5c5.webm?t=1753376621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033810/extras/eb3ffe9decea696c5c273d522188d5c5.mp4?t=1753376621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adapt to Market Fluctuations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy products when prices are low and set competitive sales prices in the dynamic market environment. Grow your business by balancing profit margins with customer satisfaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Invest and Expand</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your profits increase, invest in your market. Expand your market, upgrade your stalls, and improve the shopping environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033810/extras/361622518cfc3c0f8fa69fd9473c0ef1.poster.avif?t=1753376621\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033810/extras/361622518cfc3c0f8fa69fd9473c0ef1.webm?t=1753376621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033810/extras/361622518cfc3c0f8fa69fd9473c0ef1.mp4?t=1753376621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From Lemon Stand to Market Empire</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>&quot;Bazaar Simulator&quot;</strong>, every choice affects your success. Will you build your market empire starting from a lemon stand, or will you remain a lemon seller?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can start managing your market in the Prologue version of <strong>'Bazaar Simulator'</strong> and enjoy the limited experience. Don't forget to add and follow the full version of the game on your wishlist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Traditional Scale System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weigh your fruits and vegetables accurately using the traditional scales used in markets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033810/extras/c39cb8e77194d5dfb9a7d152c5ef8b09.poster.avif?t=1753376621\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033810/extras/c39cb8e77194d5dfb9a7d152c5ef8b09.webm?t=1753376621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033810/extras/c39cb8e77194d5dfb9a7d152c5ef8b09.mp4?t=1753376621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stock Ordering and Management</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase your stocks, organize their placement, and transfer them from crates to stalls. Remember, fruits and vegetables start to spoil over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033810/extras/dfd7cdcde7124e88c9707b79a66a68d5.poster.avif?t=1753376621\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033810/extras/dfd7cdcde7124e88c9707b79a66a68d5.webm?t=1753376621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033810/extras/dfd7cdcde7124e88c9707b79a66a68d5.mp4?t=1753376621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interactive Sales Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assist customers in their selections and manage payments both in cash and via QR code or IBAN. Ensure every customer leaves satisfied, creating repeat customers and a lively market atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033810/extras/eb3ffe9decea696c5c273d522188d5c5.poster.avif?t=1753376621\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033810/extras/eb3ffe9decea696c5c273d522188d5c5.webm?t=1753376621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033810/extras/eb3ffe9decea696c5c273d522188d5c5.mp4?t=1753376621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adapt to Market Fluctuations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy products when prices are low and set competitive sales prices in the dynamic market environment. Grow your business by balancing profit margins with customer satisfaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Invest and Expand</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your profits increase, invest in your market. Expand your market, upgrade your stalls, and improve the shopping environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033810/extras/361622518cfc3c0f8fa69fd9473c0ef1.poster.avif?t=1753376621\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033810/extras/361622518cfc3c0f8fa69fd9473c0ef1.webm?t=1753376621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033810/extras/361622518cfc3c0f8fa69fd9473c0ef1.mp4?t=1753376621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From Lemon Stand to Market Empire</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>&quot;Bazaar Simulator&quot;</strong>, every choice affects your success. Will you build your market empire starting from a lemon stand, or will you remain a lemon seller?</p>",
